<title>USA: Ralphs Grocery sees Q3 sales $1.22 bln.</title>
<headline>Ralphs Grocery sees Q3 sales $1.22 bln.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ralphs Grocery Co said late on Wednesday it expects sales for the third quarter ending October 6, 1996 to be about $1.22 billion, an increase of 1.6 percent over sales for the corresponding quarter of 1995.</p>
<p>Ralphs was acquired by Food 4 Less Holdings Inc in June 1995.</p>
